,23],[32819,18.0,1988,54,126,20],[32820,18.1,1988,55,121,24]],"links":[["Burleigh County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/burleigh-county"],["ARC or PLC in Burleigh County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/burleigh-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Burleigh County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 57% of normal in February to March and 240% in October to November. So far in 2026 it has run 60% in June to July. Grid 32220 had its driest year in 1988 at 53%, and its preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 128.0.</p>"}
